 Beach”, children will feel the warmth of the sun, the coolness of the ocean and will solve several puzzles from cards that depict letters and various fruits, vegetables, animals, and insects. Your child’s task is to find the right pair for letters and other items.\n\nSimple and intuitive understandable controls will make the first acquaintance with the letters easy and fun. Also, amazing characters will entertain your child with various sound effects and animations.\n\nPay attention to how children learn! Babies and toddlers can have fun for a long time without stress and time limit.\n\nWe are constantly adding new educational games to our application stores around the world, which you can find on our website: https://rmbgames.com/\n\nStart endless fun and education now! Try it!\n\nThanks to everyone who plays our games and appreciates them!\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/","rating":4.3,"ratingCount":"612","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=1473821215&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=880428681"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1473821215"},{"locationPosition":7,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Baby games - ABC kids & Letter","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1473821215"},{"locationPosition":8,"locationType":"similarItems","name":"You Might Also Like","idType":"relationship","id":"customers-also-bought-apps"}],"jet_adamId":"1473821215","eventType":"click","targetType":"button","targetId":"1473821215","platformContext":"iphone","alt_ab2_data":"[]"},"includingFields":["impressionsSnapshot","pageFields","contentRestrictionReasons",