ch is another easy math game for kids with a focus on shapes and geometry. In this interactive math classroom, children learn preschool math and logic in a fun way!\n-----------------------------------------------\nGAMES:\n\n• Shapes for Kids - Three math learning games that teach children to draw and differentiate 2D shapes while enhancing their visual skills & learn each shape’s name.\n• Size Recognition - In this preschool math quiz kids learn to choose larger or smaller objects and get a sense of different sizes.\n• Counting for Kids - preschoolers will learn to count shapes and develop their spatial skills with this basic math game.\n• Peek-A-Boo - children will learn directions by knocking on different doors. They will learn top left, top middle, top right, bottom left, bottom middle, and bottom right. \n• More or Less Game - Kids learn the concept more or less by choosing funny jellyfish groups.\n• Pattern Recognition Puzzle Games - Pattern recognition is great for the brain development of young kids. In these preschool math games, kids have to identify patterns with numbers, shapes, fruits, and animals. \n• Speed Learning - In this fun kid-friendly educational game children have to choose the fastest or slowest car while getting a sense of different speed levels.\n• Heavy & Light - fun preschool math quiz for learning to weight animals\n• Read the Time - an easy math game to teach children how to read an analog clock.  \n \n-----------------------------------------------\nEDU FEATURES\n\n• 16 educational kids math games and quizzes to focus on basic preschool mathematics:\n• Great for preschool children, kindergarteners, teachers, schools, homeschoolers, parents, and babysitters.\n• Instructional voice commands in 12 different languages so kids can play independently\n• Perfect app for children on the autism spectrum and special needs students\n• Unlimited access to a complete collection of mathematical games in a kid-friendly app!\n• Free without  WiFi\n• Free of third-party advertisement\n• Animated 3D characters guide children in their math learning process\n• Customizable for parents to adjust settings based on children’s learning level\n\n-----------------------------------------------\nPURCHASING, RULES & REGULATIONS\n\nEduMath2 is a free math learning game with one time in-app purchase and not a subscription-based app.\n(Cubic Frog®) respects the privacy of all its users.\nPrivacy Policy: http://www.cubicfrog.com/privacy\nTerms & Conditions :http://www.cubicfrog.com/terms\n\n\n(Cubic Frog®) is proud to be a global and multilingual kids' educational company with apps offering 12 different language options: English, Spanish, Arabic, Russian, Persian, French, German, Chinese, Korean, Japanese, and Portuguese. Learn a new language or improve on another!\n\n\nKids friendly interface helps children in their learning process. All of our math games have voice commands which help kids to learn how to listen and follow instructions. There are 16 mini math games for preschool children in this package, each of them focusing on one early learning concept in kids' education like shapes, and geometry, EduMath2  is inspired by the Montessori educational curriculum which is highly recommended for kids with autism and is a good option for speech therapy. Teach your kids basic logic and problem solving with this simple math application!","rating":4.2,"ratingCount":"1.2K","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=971313809&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=888319241"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"971313809"},{"locationPosition":8,"locationType":"lockup","name":"EduMath2- Shape Learning Games","reco_